Spec: Portable .NET public contracts

Platform: C#/.NET10

Purpose:
  Expose strict public manifest validation independently from the legacy Windows pairing model.

Structure:
  ./LinkGate.Contracts: Portable validated models and public parser.
  ./LinkGate.Contracts.Tests: Shared-corpus conformance and immutability checks.
  ./LinkGate.Control: Portable bounded control framing and strict JSON decoding.

References:
  /docs/adr/0001-public-contract-normalization.md
  /contracts/vectors/cases.json

Must:
  Return normalized declarations that match the shared expected JSON structurally.
  Keep legacy Windows pairing parsing unchanged.

Exposes:
  @LinkGate.Contracts.ManifestContract.Parse
  @LinkGate.Contracts.ManifestContract.NormalizePolicy

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Implement the public parser, immutable models and shared-corpus runner.

Done when:
  The corpus runner verifies all selected valid and invalid cases and exits nonzero on any discrepancy.
